sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as LiveKit AvatarRunner
    participant Gen as AlwaysBusyGenerator
    participant Talk as produce_talking
    participant Stream as InferenceStream
    participant Drv as InferenceDriver
    participant Sess as InferenceSession
    participant Obs as TalkingSequenceObserver

    Note over Gen: state: IDLE_ONLY

    Caller->>Gen: push_audio(frame_0)
    Gen->>Gen: acquire_sequence + _start_talking_phase
    Gen->>Talk: task created (input_queue, stream, on_first_chunk)
    Gen->>Stream: _streams.put_nowait(talking_stream)
    Note over Gen: state: WARMING (idle still driving)

    Talk->>Talk: preprocess frame_0 + flush
    Talk->>Stream: stream.put(chunk_0)
    Stream->>Drv: chunk_0 (driver still on idle)

    Note over Talk: emit() calls on_first_chunk()
    Talk->>Gen: on_first_chunk
    Gen->>Gen: _stop_idle_phase (abort idle stream)
    Note over Gen: state: TALKING

    Drv->>Drv: drain idle's ABORTED end (skipped, label=IDLE)
    Drv->>Stream: get() chunk_0
    Drv->>Sess: infer_chunk(request, on_frame)
    Sess-->>Drv: on_frame(video_0..N)
    Drv->>Drv: pair with chunk.broadcast_audio (memoryview)
    Drv->>Obs: PairedFrame(label=TALKING) via output_queue
    Obs->>Obs: on_frame → start_sequence (first frame)
    Obs->>Caller: yield (video, audio)

    Caller->>Gen: push_audio(AudioEnd)
    Gen->>Stream: input_queue.put(AudioEnd) + shutdown()
    Note over Gen: post-end pushes raise QueueShutDown → dropped

    Talk->>Talk: reads AudioEnd → preprocessor.flush
    Talk->>Stream: stream.put(final_chunks) + put(None) [COMPLETED]
    Talk-->>Gen: task done → on_finished
    Gen->>Gen: clear _talking_phase + _restart_idle_phase
    Note over Gen: state: IDLE_ONLY (new idle)

    Drv->>Stream: get() COMPLETED
    Drv->>Obs: StreamEnd(COMPLETED, label=TALKING)
    Obs->>Obs: end_sequence
    Obs->>Caller: yield SequenceEnd(COMPLETED)
